 Non. 

01:11:55.280 --> 01:11:56.920 line:63%
 Vous avez rejeté 
 chacun des dispositifs 

01:11:56.960 --> 01:11:58.000 line:63%
 de protection 
 des Français permettant 

01:11:58.040 --> 01:11:59.200 line:63%
