01:50:36.560 --> 01:50:37.560 line:61%
 - Valérie Rabault: Merci. 

01:50:37.600 --> 01:50:41.600 line:61%
 Madame la députée? 

01:50:41.640 --> 01:50:45.200 line:63%
 - Julie Laernoes: 
 Je vous propose 

01:50:45.240 --> 01:50:48.120 line:63%
