01:51:12.320 --> 01:51:16.520 line:61%
 - Valérie Rabault: Merci. 

01:51:16.560 --> 01:51:18.400 line:63%
 La parole est à madame 
 la ministre. 

01:51:18.440 --> 01:51:19.800 line:63%
 - Sarah El Haïry: 
 Madame la députée, 

01:51:19.840 --> 01:51:20.840 line:61%
