01:52:44.440 --> 01:52:48.000 line:61%
 La vie ne les épargne pas. 

01:52:48.040 --> 01:52:51.520 line:63%
 Ces personnes ont vécu 
 vos lois plein emploi 

01:52:51.560 --> 01:52:52.720 line:63%
