 comme des citoyens 

01:52:53.800 --> 01:52:58.160 line:61%
 de second rang. 

01:52:58.200 --> 01:52:59.360 line:63%
 Dans certaines zones, 
 sur 80 embauches, 

01:52:59.400 --> 01:53:01.120 line:63%
