 et favoriser l'emploi 

01:56:12.320 --> 01:56:19.440 line:61%
 de 80.000 personnes. 

01:56:19.480 --> 01:56:20.640 line:63%
 80% des habitants 
 du département attendent 

01:56:20.680 --> 01:56:25.080 line:61%
