 de cet hémicycle. 

01:57:29.880 --> 01:57:31.640 line:63%
 - Valérie Rabault: 
 La parole est à monsieur Gérald 

01:57:31.680 --> 01:57:34.360 line:61%
 Darmanin. 

01:57:35.920 --> 01:57:44.560 line:61%
 - Gérald Darmanin: Merci. 

01:58:00.560 --> 01:58:01.920 line:63%
 Tous soutiennent ce projet 
 d'infrastructure reconnu d'utilité 

01:58:01.960 --> 01:58:03.480 line:61%
 publique. 

